msgctxt "artwork"
msgid "art.apples_and_oranges.date"
msgstr "hacia 1899"

#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Player-facing artwork text.
#. English: A still life of fruit, white cloth and vessels. In the pixel interpretation, orange and red fruit stand out against the pale cloth.
msgctxt "artwork"
msgid "art.apples_and_oranges.description"
msgstr "Bodegón de frutas, tela blanca y recipientes. En la versión en píxeles, las frutas naranjas y rojas destacan sobre la tela clara."

#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Player-facing artwork text.
#. English: The vessels and table do not share exactly the same viewpoint; Cézanne does not follow a single perspective.
msgctxt "artwork"
msgid "art.apples_and_oranges.fact_1"
msgstr "Los recipientes y la mesa no comparten exactamente el mismo punto de vista; Cézanne no sigue una perspectiva única."

#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Player-facing artwork text.
#. English: The cloth is not painted in white alone: it also carries reflections of the surrounding colors.
msgctxt "artwork"
msgid "art.apples_and_oranges.fact_2"
msgstr "La tela no está pintada solo de blanco: también refleja los colores del entorno."

#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Fictional demo dialogue; no campaign reward.
#. English: The last work of this level. Open the way from the bottom to the final pixel.
msgctxt "story"
msgid "art.apples_and_oranges.intro"
msgstr "La última obra de este nivel. Abre camino desde abajo hasta el último píxel."

#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Fictional demo dialogue; no campaign reward.
