#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Player-facing artwork text.
#. English: The Birth of Venus is a Renaissance painting in tempera on canvas. The goddess at its center stands on a seashell.
msgctxt "artwork"
msgid "art.birth_of_venus.description"
msgstr "El nacimiento de Venus es una pintura renacentista al temple sobre lienzo. La diosa central está sobre una concha."

#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Player-facing artwork text.
#. English: Despite the title, the scene depicts Venus arriving on Cyprus with the help of the winds, rather than her birth.
msgctxt "artwork"
msgid "art.birth_of_venus.fact_1"
msgstr "Pese al título, la escena muestra la llegada de Venus a Chipre con ayuda de los vientos, no su nacimiento."

#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Player-facing artwork text.
#. English: Gold highlights the hair and other details. The pose draws on classical sculpture.
msgctxt "artwork"
msgid "art.birth_of_venus.fact_2"
msgstr "El oro ilumina el cabello y otros detalles. La postura remite a la escultura clásica."

#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Fictional demo dialogue; no campaign reward.
#. English: Compare the pale tones. The painting's colors wait for you; they never expire.
msgctxt "story"
msgid "art.birth_of_venus.intro"
msgstr "Compara los tonos claros. Los colores del cuadro te esperan; nunca caducan."

#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Fictional demo dialogue; no campaign reward.
