#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Player-facing artwork text.
#. English: An oil painting of light and crowds in an open-air dance garden in Montmartre. The game renders the crowd as small clusters of color.
msgctxt "artwork"
msgid "art.dance_at_le_moulin_de_la_galette.description"
msgstr "Óleo de la luz y la multitud en un baile al aire libre de Montmartre. El juego representa la gente con pequeños grupos de color."

#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Player-facing artwork text.
#. English: Shown at the 1877 Impressionist exhibition, the painting includes some of Renoir's friends in the crowd.
msgctxt "artwork"
msgid "art.dance_at_le_moulin_de_la_galette.fact_1"
msgstr "Presentado en la exposición impresionista de 1877, incluye entre la multitud a amigos de Renoir."

#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Player-facing artwork text.
#. English: The painting brings together natural and artificial light across a moving crowd.
msgctxt "artwork"
msgid "art.dance_at_le_moulin_de_la_galette.fact_2"
msgstr "El cuadro combina luz natural y artificial sobre una multitud en movimiento."

#. Keep named placeholders and proper names. Fictional demo dialogue; no campaign reward.
#. English: The crowd hides the colors. A question-mark packet reveals when it reaches the front.
msgctxt "story"
msgid "art.dance_at_le_moulin_de_la_galette.intro"
msgstr "La multitud oculta los colores. Una caja con interrogante se revela al llegar delante."

