#. English: One verified fragment is a beginning
msgid "news.verified_fragment_headline"
msgstr "Un fragmento verificado es un comienzo"

#. P07 optional museum reading and curation.
#. English: A record in added conservation material has been archived after the reconstruction of {art}. It is a later addition in this fictional case, not a message by the original artist.
msgid "news.verified_fragment_p1"
msgstr "Tras reconstruir {art}, se archivó un documento hallado en material de restauración añadido. En este caso ficticio es un añadido posterior, no un mensaje del artista."

#. P07 optional museum reading and curation.
#. English: The fragment can be checked even if the object changes hands. It does not by itself settle every ownership claim.
msgid "news.verified_fragment_p2"
msgstr "El fragmento puede examinarse aunque el objeto cambie de manos. Por sí solo no resuelve toda reclamación de propiedad."

